WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

The MIT terms above apply to the source code of this project: the graph engine,
the web application, the scripts, the Helm chart and the documentation.

They do not, and cannot, cover the third-party material this project refers to:

* Marvel, the Marvel Cinematic Universe, and every film and series name in the
  dataset are trademarks of Marvel Characters, Inc. and The Walt Disney
  Company. This is an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with, endorsed by
  or sponsored by them. The dataset stores title names and the relationships
  between them, and no media.

* The watch-order graph in data/marvel-graph.json is transcribed from
  "A smarter MCU watch order" by Rocked03, published on r/marvelstudios:
  https://www.reddit.com/r/marvelstudios/s/Yc9CunxbWr
  The ordering and the arrow-by-arrow judgement calls are that author's work.
  This project only puts them into machine-readable form. Please credit the
  original if you reuse the data.

* Poster artwork, backdrops and synopses come from The Movie Database (TMDB)
  and are subject to TMDB's terms. This product uses the TMDB API but is not
  endorsed or certified by TMDB.

Reusing the code is straightforward. Reusing the dataset, or running this
project commercially, means dealing with the three points above yourself.
